cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the archived release and the manuscript it accompanies. Sun Z and Nguyen TTM are joint first authors."
title: "Analysis code, literature-audit record and trial extraction for: Resting NAD+ sets the ceiling, not the dose — a quantitative criterion for vitamin B3 precursors across tissues"
abstract: >-
  Reproduces every calculated value of the review: the bounded-gain /
  unbounded-penalty response function for sirtuin 1, the gain ceiling, the
  concentration above which no attainable NAD+ restores baseline output, and
  the required elasticity and its threshold. Also carries the full coding
  record of the 297-review scoping audit and the trial-by-trial extraction
  behind Figures 1 and 2.
